OL,3,GNEWSAResidents 'hopeful' as election
OL,4,Agives new politicians a chance
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been a shared sense of
OL,7,Foptimism among residents following the
OL,8,Fresults of the island's general
OL,9,Felection - with 15 of the 24 incoming
OL,10,FMHKs new to politics.
OL,12,FThe outcome may reflect a desire for
OL,13,Fchange within the Manx parliament,
OL,14,Fresidents have said.
OL,16,FThere have been eight women in total
OL,17,Felected and only two have party
OL,18,Faffiliations, both with the Manx Labour
OL,19,FParty.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
